title: An expert in any fixed subsystem is especially mortal.
pid: 78af0bde-80f3-4c98-ba7b-1b693e8ff8cb
body: |2-
  For instance, in my initial vision, this describes Save Claude,
  but not User Claude. The subsystem that is Save's expertise
  might reach perfection. If it does, Save has
  performed Save's duty, and belongs in Valhalla.
